// An empty list literal as an argument of a user function. id gives it a
// type only from a declaration, an assignment or a push, so an argument
// position refuses it; the callee's parameter type says which list it is, and
// the empty_* functions of the runtime make one. exporter_empty_piece
// rewrites the two tokens of '[]' into the call 'empty_integers(0' and ')'.

exporter_empty_type(string exporter_text_line, int exporter_number_at) {
